<title>USA: Aquagen enters into agreement with VIP.</title>
<headline>Aquagen enters into agreement with VIP.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aquagen International Inc said on Tuesday it eneterd into an agreement with VIP Worldnet Inc on November 15.</p>
<p>Aquagen acquired 100 percent ownership to all manufacturing rights and proprietary formulas for their stabilized water-oxygen product.</p>
<p>They also acquired inventory totalling $1.5 million as part of the transaction.</p>
<p>The acquisition was accomplished by stock and royalties from Aquagen to VIP.</p>
